Yes, in nethack, Illness (Ill on the status line) is fatal.  There are
any number of ways to cure this illness, though.  Applying a unicorn
horn has a decent chance of doing it (apply repeatedly if the first
try or two don't work).  The spell cure sickness will remove illness
as well.  I think eucalyptus leaves will also work (eat it), but I'm
not sure, and have never tried it.  I think this is why they were
added to nethack.

Also, like all quest nemeses, he is stoning resistant, and can
teleport away to heal up when sufficiently damaged.  The secret is
that he will always teleport away to one particular place.  If you can
get there before him, or keep him from getting there in the first
place, he's not that hard to kill.
 
